# Source data held locally for import (docs/LOCAL_DATABASE.md).
# The full PESEL national CSVs are ~5 MB each and are NOT fixtures: the small
# verbatim excerpts in fixtures/pesel/ are, and they share the same file names.
# Keep the full files here so neither gets committed or overwritten.
data/

# Agent instruction files that `next dev` generates inside each app
# (node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js). They are vendor
# boilerplate, not this project's operating contract — and in a repository where
# the root AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md ARE that contract (AGENTS.md §1), a generated
# file of the same name one directory down is actively misleading. The generated
# text argues for committing it; that is a tool's output, not a project decision.
apps/*/AGENTS.md
apps/*/CLAUDE.md

# Playwright output (TASK-103)
tests/e2e/test-results/
tests/e2e/playwright-report/
